16:["$","aside",null,{"className":"docs_toc__B_lbZ","aria-label":"On this page","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"ON THIS PAGE"}],[["$","a","the-basic-idea",{"href":"#the-basic-idea","children":"The basic idea"}],["$","a","diagram-one-request-two-paths",{"href":"#diagram-one-request-two-paths","children":"Diagram: one request, two paths"}],["$","a","why-use-a-queue",{"href":"#why-use-a-queue","children":"Why use a queue?"}],["$","a","when-is-a-direct-call-simpler",{"href":"#when-is-a-direct-call-simpler","children":"When is a direct call simpler?"}],["$","a","a-first-professional-check",{"href":"#a-first-professional-check","children":"A first professional check"}],["$","a","try-it",{"href":"#try-it","children":"Try it"}],["$","a","check-your-understanding",{"href":"#check-your-understanding","children":"Check your understanding"}],["$","a","read-further",{"href":"#read-further","children":"Read further"}]]]}]
17:["$","main",null,{"className":"docs_main__7o2m6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"docs_articleMeta__8zYHO","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"LESSON 01 OF 8"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Systems"}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"docs_article__Ja_Vh","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":[[["$","h1","h1-0",{"children":"What a queue is and when to use one"}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["You click ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Export document"}],". Creating the file may take a minute, but the website can respond immediately: “Your export has started.” How can it finish the work after the response? It can place an export job in a ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"queue"}]," for a background worker to process."]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"the-basic-idea","children":"The basic idea"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["A queue holds messages representing work that has not yet been completed. One part of a system ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"produces"}]," a message; another part ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"consumes"}]," it. A queue service, often called a ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"broker"}],", stores and delivers messages between them. The producer and consumer do not have to run at the same time or at the same speed."]}],"\n",["$","table","table-0",{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":"Term"}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":"Plain meaning"}],["$","th","th-2",{"children":"Export example"}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":[["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Producer"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Adds work"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"The export API"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-1",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Message or job"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"A description of work"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":["“Generate export ",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"exp_82"}],"”"]}]]}],["$","tr","tr-2",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Queue or broker"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Holds and delivers waiting work"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"An export-jobs queue"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-3",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Consumer or worker"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Takes work and performs it"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"A process that creates the file"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-4",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Result store"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Records what happened"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"An export status row and file reference"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["The queue normally holds a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"small instruction or reference"}],", not the entire document. The worker uses the export ID to load the current inputs and records the result where the website can find it. The queue and the result store have different jobs: the queue transports work; the result store answers “what happened to my export?”"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"diagram-one-request-two-paths","children":"Diagram: one request, two paths"}],"\n",["$","figure","p-3",{"className":"docs_studyFigure__4Js_y","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"docs_studyFigureViewport__ZYDNN","children":["$","img","img-0",{"className":"docs_studyFigureImage__Gb2YJ","src":"/learning/async-systems/queue-basics.svg","alt":"An export request enters an API, an export job waits in a queue, and a worker creates the file while the user continues.","width":"920","height":"402","loading":"lazy"}]}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"An export request enters an API, an export job waits in a queue, and a worker creates the file while the user continues."}]]}],"\n",["$","details","pre-0",{"className":"docs_textDiagram__KfHuf","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"Read the text version of this flow"}],["$","pre",null,{"children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"language-aosdf-diagram","children":"User ──▶ Export API ──▶ Queue ──▶ Worker ──▶ File + completed status\n           │\n           └──▶ “Started: exp_82” ──▶ User checks status later\n"}]}]]}],"\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37"],false]}]]}],"$L38"]}]
